# The slowdown along the arena wall with the bot beside (the fps readout: fps is timed by the
# SH-2's free running counter, vbl is the old vblank count, to compare). The arena shrinks to
# 4000 across so the walls and the bot are close; termination off. The cycle rides north to
# just short of the wall, turns right and runs along it. A shot a second.
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
skip_prologue # straight to play, the cycle at its start
wait 12.4
press start
press z
press x 6
press start
wait 3.6
press right
shot wall_1
wait 1
shot wall_2
wait 1
shot wall_3
wait 1
shot wall_4
wait 1
shot wall_5
wait 1
shot wall_6
